        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo nyika eyo njemuyoovuba tiili mbuli nyika ya-Egepira nkumwakazwa, nkumwakali kubyala imbuto zyanu akuzitilaizya amaulu aanu mbuli muunda wazisyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
