          "text": "Takukooyooba muntu naba omwe uukonzya kumulwisya, nkaambo Jehova Leza wanu uyoocita kuti bantu banyika yoonse nkumuyooinda bayoowe akukankama kubusyu bwanu, mbubonya mbwaakamwaambila.",
