              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sa tazili mutala lya-Jordano, kumbo lyanzila, kumabbililo aazuba, munyika yaba-Kanana bakede muAraba, kubambene a-Giligala, kumbali lyamubanga wa-More? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.30",
